## CQ-JO-02 | JEI: Fishing Rods and Backpacks groups after the material families; Wardrobe backpacks and Simple Hats unsorted
@group client
@commands set `orderReport = true` under `[jei]`; restart the client; latest.log `[jeiOrder]` lines; JEI item list from the start; the order report's conflicts and unknown ids
@pass after the last material family: the vanilla, iron, gold, diamond and netherite fishing rods and the three rod upgrades, then Quark's and Sophisticated Backpacks' backpacks (basic to netherite), then misc; no rod or backpack inside a family; Wardrobe's three backpacks and the Simple Hats items after every category; no conflict or unknown id for `equipment/fishing_rods` or `equipment/backpacks`; no `[item_dict]` missing key for the `jeiI` entries
@fails `order.js` group ids or `jeiI` keys missing from the dicts; an item still listed in a family `list`
